# decision-defined-as-exists root (#189 IMPL 3 fold fix / #270)
library "Pol".

// A decision + `code is` library whose decision guard is a `defined as exists`
// concept. `defined as exists` lowers on the STANDARD lane (#265) but NOT on the
// case-feature Inferred lane (#270), which the interface split uses — so
// `emitConceptBody` throws the UNTYPED `definedAsExistsNotLowered`. The FHIR fold
// must treat that kind-less throw as manifest-failing (not drop it) so
// `emitFhirDefFromPath` does NOT report a misleading `success:true`.

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `adult`.

concept "Has Adult":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Adult Patient" ).

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage":
- when "Has Adult" then recommend activity "Refer".
